@page "/about";

<h3>About</h3>

<div>
    <p>This is an application using Blazor pages to manage a wardrobe.</p>
    <p>Clothes can be added as well with an uploaded image. They can also be put into cloth sets to keep track of favourite outfits.</p>
    <p>The SQLite server is running on the Blazor application using Entity Framework.</p>
    <p>The UI is handled using blazor in conjonction with Boostrap and Blazor Bootstrap.</p>
    <p>For more information about me, check my <a href="https://zubepb.github.io/" target="_blank" class="home-name link-info link-underline-opacity-0">Portfolio</a>.</p>
    <p>For more information about the project instructions see <a href="https://thecsharpacademy.com/project/39/wardrobe-inventory" target="_blank" class="home-name link-warning link-underline-opacity-0">The C# Academy</a>.</p>
</div>

